window.products.push({"id":499034,"name":"2 Pack Turkish Beach Towel Quick Dry Absorbent 1OO% Cotton Lightweight Thin Bathroom Bath Pool Swim Towels Extra Large Oversized Sand Free Towel Beach","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919+HLm0xcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Large Size and Comfortable Towel]: Measuring 36\"x75\" include fringes, our beach towel is larger than regular towels. It can cover your entire body or sun lounger, and you can even share it with friends and family for a comfortable space. And the soft fabric - newly developed pure cotton, mild and skin-friendly, allows you to spend a good leisure time in comfort. [Super Absorbent and Quick Dry]: When you are on vacation by the sea, are you troubled by the problem that the beach towel does not absorb water and dry slow? Now, super absorbent and quick dry turkish beach towel is here!Just wipe it lightly and the water is gone! And this towel dries 3 times faster than other towels,saving your time.Just let it sit for a few minutes and it's dry! Let you avoid the embarrassment and cold after bathing, swimming in the pool, swimming in the beach. [Lightweight and Sand Free]: The beach towels make your holiday more relaxing and enjoyable! Compared with other beach towels, this beach towel is lighter and more breathable. And it is compact and easy to fold, which is very space-saving. Pack it in a bag and go anytime! Besides, when you're done playing at the beach, just give it a shake, leave the sands where they belong to! [Multi Use]: The beach towels is destined to flourish your vacation for its versatility everywhere: beach, sports, yoga, pool, travel, bathroom, camping, room decor, etc. Besides, this beach towel has many styles, various colors and beautiful appearance. It is suitable for giving your family,lover, friends, colleagues, etc. on various festivals such as birthday, Christmas, Valentine's Day,Morther's Day etc. It is a high-end gift perfectly. [Easy to Wash]: When you come back to home from a happy holiday, you don't have to worry about the difficulty of washing the beach towels. This beach towel can withstand multiple washes, you just throw it in the washing machine and it's clean and undeformed!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919+HLm0xcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Widdonen","source_asin":"B0C1ZGRYYL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-499034","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1ZGRYYL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1ZGRYYL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
