window.products.push({"id":499079,"name":"Department 56 Sports and Leisure Santa Duck Decoys Figurine, 10.5 Inch, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.01,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RnsnUm3FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed in the US, every Possible Dreams Santa is hand-made by a team of skilled artisans. Individually sculpted with unique facial expressions and poses, personality and sometimes humor - no two Santa's are the same! Each piece is painted and assembled with intricate detail and artistic expertise. Our signature stiffened fabric, mixed media, bottom stamp and brass tag certifies an authentic Possible Dreams Santa. Possible Dreams Sports and Leisure Collection shows Santa still keeping busy even when he isn't delivering presents! On his off days, Santa enjoys many hobbies, public services, and sports, and he always finds time for fun in the snow with Mrs. Claus and friends! Carving wood decoys is one of Santa's favorite hobbies. His pockets hold all his needed supplies. About Department 56: For 40 years, Department 56 has been creating holiday traditions passed down from generation to generation. The excitement of the holiday season comes home with intricately detailed villages from settings that inspire the imagination. Stroll through a small American town, enjoy a walk with Charles Dickens, or visit Santa in the North Pole. Our ornaments and figurines create even more opportunities to spread good wishes during the happiest time of the year.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RnsnUm3FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B08THXGPDH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-499079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08THXGPDH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08THXGPDH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
