window.products.push({"id":499087,"name":"Samhe Toothbrush Holder with Toothpaste Dispenser and 2 Magnetic Cups, Wall Mounted Space Saving Bathroom Organizer for Toothbrush Toothpaste","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a-U4riehL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Multi-functional: Toothbrush holder comes with 1x automatic toothpaste dispenser, 1x small drawer(store your watch jewelry lipstick and other small accessories need waterproof), 1x big shallow slot(store toiletries that have flat bottom), 1 small deep slot(store razer comb toothpaste and more) and 2 magnetic cups. Convenient: Toothbrushes slots are hidden, ventilated and breathable, dries quickly and stay clean. There are magnet at bottom of the cup so you can hanging it upside down. The whole holder can also be easily removed and clean. Easy to Install: Comes with strong adhesive hook and you can easy paste it on smooth surface like wall tile glass, no drill, no tool, then hang your toothbrush holder on. Please leave it alone for 2 hours for better adhesion before hanging. This toothbrush holder has a maximum load of 200 ounces. Premium Material: The toothbrush holder and cups are made of high quality ABS material, smooth and uncut hands, strong, durable and safe to use. It's a perfect bathroom accessories for both you and your families. 100% RISK-FREE: If our toothbrush holder is not suitable for you or has any quality issues. Please feel free to contact us. we will provide a full refund or send a replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a-U4riehL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Samhe","source_asin":"B08K7FSDZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-499087","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K7FSDZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K7FSDZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
