window.products.push({"id":499167,"name":"Sleepmax Pillows Standard Size Set of 2, Cotton Cover Pillows for Sleeping, Bed Pillows for Side Stomach Back Sleepers, Standard Pillows Quality Hotel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JJivmMUzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% PREMIUM COTTON SHELL - Try the irresistible comfort of Sleepmax premium sleeping pillows! Unlike other polyester cover pillows, Sleepmax pillows adopt 100% cotton fabric to provide you maximum softness and breathablity while sleeping. BREATHABLE & SOFT- We use a high thread count on our cotton exterior, it's ultra skin-friendly and soft. You can feel significant comfort without usual sweat and odor that tend to appear with low thread count pillows. FIVE STAR INDULGENCE - These pillows queen size set of 2 are filled with fluffy 3D+7D microfiber for a pleasing loft and smoothness. Ultra-soft and fluffy as real down yet provide adequate support sleeping pillows for your head and neck, just indulge yourself like in a five-star hotel. It suits for all sleepers, side, back and stomach sleepers. MACHINE WASHABLE EASY CARE - High-quality materials keep their shape without bunching or distorting, no matter how long you use them. Need washing? Simply throw it into your washing machine and tumble dry. The pillows for sleeping will always feel and look like new, no clumping! GREAT GIFT IDEA - This pillows can be set in bedroom, guest room, hotel or dorm, it's also a great gift package for your families or friends. Upon receipt, squeeze and pat the pillows and air them for several hours to recover their full loft.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JJivmMUzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sleepmax","source_asin":"B08RYWGSRV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-499167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RYWGSRV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RYWGSRV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":499168,"name":"LAKE ERIE (5 OF 5) COMMEMORATIVE GREAT LAKES LIGHTHOUSES W/ ACTUAL SAND ENCLOSED WITHIN IT'S BASE & TRIMMED WITH 22K GOLD, INCLUDING THE GREAT LAKES N","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zfOmPcT7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Welcome to a journey, a journey to one of the most spectacular places on earth, a water wonderland known as the Great Lakes. Great Lakes Sands proudly presents a very unique and one of a kind gift, a miniature lighthouse set that contains the ACTUAL and AUTHENTIC beach sand from each of the five individual great lakes. This handsome collection is truly a \"must have\" for any lighthouse lover, anyone fascinated by nautical lore, admirer's of Northern American history, and anyone who simply enjoys the magnificence and splendor of our majestic Great Lakes. Each 4 inch glass lighthouse is individually handcrafted and elegantly adorned in sparkling 22k gold trim, which includes the Great Lakes' name. All five lighthouses are mounted on a beautifully routered and diamond-polished solid acrylic base. Each set also includes a certificate of authenticity and comes securely packaged in a custom box. If the sands of time could talk, Ohh.. the stories they would tell, the memories they'd reveal and the secrets they would whisper about North America's crown jewel, the Great Lakes. Don't miss your opportunity to capture these tiny treasures that have withstood the waves of time. Erie Lake Erie may very well be the most used, most enjoyed, and perhaps the most loved of all the Great Lakes. Gorgeous beaches abound on the magnificent body of water. This lake teems with boating, swimming, and sport fishing. Its walleye fishery is generally considered to be one of the best in the world. Along with popular islands, the most well known is \"Put-in-Bay,\" referred to as the Mardi Gras of the north. On Lake Erie's south shore is Cedar Point, 30 miles west of Cleveland, in Sandusky, Ohio. It is the \"roller coaster capital\" and one of the best amusement parks in the world, drawing millions to its waterfront every summer. Almost 1/3 of the total population of the Great Lakes, reside in the Lake Erie region.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zfOmPcT7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Great Lakes Collectibles NaoHiRo","source_asin":"B0045X2QEQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-499168","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0045X2QEQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0045X2QEQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
