window.products.push({"id":499396,"name":"Towel Warmer for Bathroom, Portable Hot Towel Warmer Bucket, 60mins Auto Shut Off, Bucket Style Large Towel Warmers for Bathroom, Home, Fits Up to Two","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PzbWNygkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nullify PAMPER YOURSELF AND YOUR FAMILY- If you're looking for a simple and stylish home decor that will make your space look and feel a little more spa-like, the Ultra Large Luxury Towel Warmer is just the right thing for you. You will feel pampered and notice a big difference in your shower routine when using this warmer- no more cold feeling getting out of bath. Also, it makes a sweet Christmas gift for close friends or for that person on your list that is always cold. LARGE HEATING COMPARTMENT - With a total of 20 Liter capacity inside the volume, this towel heater accommodates up to two 70''X40'' oversized bath towels, robes, throw blankets, PJs, and more at once or larger bath sheets. It's a must-have household appliance for big families. HEAT FAST AND EVENLY- The towel dryer heat up within just 1 minute and reaches high temperature in just 6 minutes. It takes just 15 minutes, 2 large towels will be toasted perfectly and heated evenly. This Luxury Bucket Towel Warmer is single button control, provides you with up to 60 minutes of warming. No more cold spots when you cover yourself with a warm-up towel. PORTABLE TOWEL WARMER. INSTALLATION FREE - Some towel heaters need to be drilled into the wall to set up the whole thing, while our bucket-style bath towel warmer just needs to be plugged into a nearby outlet. It can be placed everywhere on the dry floor. This freestanding towel warmer has a stylish design and is easy to move. You might consider placing it in your bathroom, bedroom, nursery, living room. The towel warmers make your life more cozy and luxurious in an easy way. AUTOMATIC SHUT OFF FOR SAFETY USE - Our bucket towel warmer is ETL&FCC certificated, safe and reliable. The towel warmers are designed with an automatic shutoff function to prevent safety issues, it will shut off automatically after 60 minutes of heating time. There is a novel and thoughtful design of our blanket warmer: unlike removable lids, our lid is connected to the bucket, the flip-lid will free your hands while you get the towel out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PzbWNygkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Guioiby","source_asin":"B0B1TYFXTQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-499396","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1TYFXTQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1TYFXTQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
