window.products.push({"id":499476,"name":"Party Pastel Balloons 150 pcs Macaron Balloons kit for Birthday Baby Shower Wedding Engagement Anniversay Christmas Festival Picnic or Friends & Famil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aGyAUqM8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🎈COLOR MATCHING: We selected the best-selling balloon color combinations that our customers have purchased from our wealth of sales data. Each solid color balloons matches white balloons, blue and pink balloons, blue and yellow balloons, pink and purple balloons, pink and blush balloons. These balloons kit are best choices for your different theme party. 🎈PACKAGE：Matte pastel balloons is the most popular this year. The major colors are blue, pink, mint, yellow, blush, purple. The packaging include: 10 inch balloons 10 pcs for each color(six colors), 5 inch balloons 15pcs for each color(six colors). You can make them into a balloon garland, heart shape, a ball, a wall... what ever you like. 🎈QUALITY: These latex balloons are durable and 20% thicker than average latex balloons. They can be reused for all indoor and outdoor party decorations. The round balloons can be filled with air and helium. The long-lasting balloons filled with air will stay fulll for a month, while with Helium will stay for 24 hours. 🎈ATTENTION & WARNING: Certain color difference occurs after inflation, but the color effect will be better. Please DO NOT overfill the pastel balloons and also avoid sunburn, overheat, pointed object and excessive friction. Due to automatic packing system, please understand that any holes or popped balloons within 1-3 pcs for one pack Balloons is a normal phenomenon. 🎈SECURITY & WARRANTY: These party balloons are all non-toxic and eco-friendly. If you have any problem or unsatisfied, Please keep in touch with us first. We guarantee a full refund and we are always here for you in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aGyAUqM8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANAHAT","source_asin":"B09Z6KGG8V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-499476","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z6KGG8V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z6KGG8V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
