window.products.push({"id":499509,"name":"SINLAND Linen Napkins 20x20 inch Oversized Stripe Dinner Napkins Soft Washable Cloth Napkins for Parties Dinners Weddings Cocktail & Home Use Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81q0alnHRzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The material is 20% linen, 40% cotton and 40% polyester. The size is 20inch x 20inch,it is so big that makes your meals more comfortable. It can make you feel as though you really have your life together. The quality of the linen material ensures ease in taking care of the napkins.Unlike cheap, bulky polyester restaurant napkins, our linens are lightweight, crisp and elegant with an exquisite feel. The beauty of each linen napkin is the natural fibers and classic aesthetic that mellows with each washing, betters with age and requires minimal care. The napkins have not lost any color with washing. Maybe a little wrinkly after washing, but If you drape them over a line, you usually don’t need to iron them and can smooth out the wrinkles with your hands as you fold them up and put them away.If need ironed,hot ironing is recommended while the napkins are still slightly damp These napkins can be used in many ways, as cocktail napkins, wedding napkins, party napkins, birthday napkins or banquet napkins.But most importantly they should make your life more comfortable, cozy, and pleasurable,guaranteed to add a touch of class to your dining experience.So if you have any questions or comments, feel free to contact us, we will do our best to solve a problem and make you satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81q0alnHRzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SINLAND","source_asin":"B075G7K33N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-499509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075G7K33N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075G7K33N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
