window.products.push({"id":499672,"name":"Good Living Set of 2 Sip-A-Bowl Cereal Bowls With Built-In Straw, Blue, 1-pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81j2-IND5xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Breakfast is the most important meal of the day. The hustle and bustle of getting ready in the morning sometimes makes it difficult to sit down for a whole meal. As everyone knows, trying to get something done quickly can often result in spills and messes when your children want to drink down that last bit of milk from the cereal bowl. With a straw built-in to the side of the bowl, your child can finish their food and then drink the milk without the hazard of spilling milk all over their clothes and the table. Each bowl has fun and bright colors that they love, helping you determine which child each bowl belongs to. Add this bowl to your cabinet to eliminate one mess out of chaotic mornings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81j2-IND5xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Good Living","source_asin":"B00E4WT5NS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-499672","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00E4WT5NS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00E4WT5NS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":499673,"name":"Coffee Mug Warmer, Electric Beverage Warmer, 3 Adjustable Mode Up to 55℃, Waterproof LED Backlit Display, Auto Shut Off, Water Coco Soup Milk","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.67,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JPOEVaKqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Cautions 1. During long periods of non-use, pull out the plug or turn off the power switch  2. The warmer is to only keep the temperature at 40-60℃ , can't boil water  3. Easy to clean up but don't wash the product in water  4.Turns off when there’s no cup on cause it’s pressure sensitive switch 5. Non-professionals are forbidden to take the bottom cover apart  6. The warmer is hot when it is working, please don’t touch it. Keep out of the reach of children and pets to avoid any accidents scalding 7. The warming effect is different on different materials, it works best with a flat bottom metal, ceramic, enamel, tile, glassware, high temperature plastic etc Specifications: Cable length: 1.5m Weight: 8 ounces Input: 110V  Power: 15W  Product Dimensions: 4.7 x 4.7 x 0.7 inches Material: sleek glass + aluminum alloy plate + copper(inside) Package include 1 X Coffee mug warmer 1 X User Manual Disclaimer : Be sure to not mistake this warmer as a cooktop! If you have a hot cup of coffee you don't want it to get cold, that’s what we’re here for - Maintaining temperatures, Not heating up leftovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JPOEVaKqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LYTPW","source_asin":"B08QHQVVJX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-499673","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QHQVVJX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QHQVVJX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":499674,"name":"Loud Alarm Clock for Heavy Sleepers Adults, Teenagers, Teens, Kids, Digital Alarm Clock with 8 RGB Night Lights, 0%-100% Dimmable, Sleep Aid, Dual Ala","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dmyjuZcBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⏰【Large Led Mirror Surface Display & Power Off Memory Funtion & USB Charging Port 】Digital alarm clock with large LED mirror display is very easy to read the time, stylish and beautiful, and can be used as a mirror. The built-in CR2032 battery keeps the time and alarm settings unchanged in case of power failure. In addition, there is a 5V/1A USB charging port on the right side of the led digital clock to safely charge your electronic devices, which is very practical and convenient. ⏰【8 Modes Night Lights & RGB Dynamic Colors 】This night light alarm clock has 5 solid color lights (blue, pink, yellow, white, red) and 3 smooth and colorful ambient lights. Under the RGB colorful dynamic lighting effect, it can realize the visual effect of flowing light and color, and create a romantic and soothing atmosphere. You can choose your favorite light mode as night light/bedside lamp/reading light/mood light, with 10 adjustable brightness settings. ⏰【Dual Alarms & Snooze Supported】Built-in dual alarms, with three alarm time modes, you can set the daily mode/weekday mode /weekend mode for the corresponding alarm. In addition, the led desk clock is designed with a big snooze button on the top, which can help you easily turn off the alarm without opening your eyes, and get an extra 9 mins of sleep time (unlimited snooze times). And if there is no operation within 20 mins when the alarm sounds, the alarm will automatically turn off. ⏰【7 Wake-up Sounds & 16 Volume Levels】The bedroom led bedside clock offers 7 alarm sounds (bell/ocean/waves/bird/beep/piano/soft music) and you can pick your favorite sound to wake up in the morning. When the alarm goes off, the sound is soft and soothing at first, then gradually louder to prevent you from being woken up by a sudden loud noise. With 16 adjustable volume levels, the volume can be selected according to the depth of sleep, suitable for kids, teenagers, adults, and heavy sleepers. ⏰【8 Soothing Sounds & Sleep Timer】The LED kids alarm clock features 8 smooth sounds, like a sound machine, to get your little ones and older kids into deep, restful sleep. With the help of an adjustable sleep timer for 10-120 mins, natural sounds and lights can automatically turn off when the timer expires to aid sleep. And if you feel that the LED screen is too bright and affects sleep, you can easily adjust the brightness with the help of the dimmer on the side of the alarm clock for heavy sleepers adults kids. ⏰【Great Gift Choice for Loved Ones】Designed to be practical and stylish, this alarm clock with light is perfect for aesthetic room decor. And the versatility and beautiful appearance make it an ideal gift for Christmas, Easter, Halloween, New Year, Valentine's Day, Thanksgiving, birthdays, anniversaries, Children's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, etc. It is also the great holiday gift for teenager girls boys, kids, friends, loved ones and family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dmyjuZcBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AFEXOA","source_asin":"B0BWF2JTM6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-499674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWF2JTM6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWF2JTM6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
