window.products.push({"id":499682,"name":"Rocky Mountain Goods Pro Source Plate Hanger for Wall and Mounting Hardware - Fits Decorative Plates and platters - Heavy duty polished brass - Non sc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vg8OzCV0L._AC_.jpg","description":"Rocky Mountain Goods Plate Hanger for Wall and Mounting Hardware is the best hanging wall plate design on the market. The extra strength brass springs securely hold your plate or platter in place and maintain that secured size without loosening. An included wall mount installation kit makes for simple install by nailing mount and hanging the plate or tray. Clear inconspicuous vinyl hooks are hardly noticeable and keep the plate firmly displayed. Rocky Mountain Goods Plate Hanger for Wall and Mounting Hardware comes in all size options and includes a lifetime warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vg8OzCV0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rocky Mountain Radar","source_asin":"B06X6GD858","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-499682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06X6GD858","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06X6GD858","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
