window.products.push({"id":499695,"name":"LUKO 9,000 BTU 3-in-1 Portable Air Conditioner with Dehumidifier,Fan,AC air conditioner for Rooms up to 400 sq ft","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Se2LRuQVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄【POWERFUL COOLING CAPACITY】The 8000 BTU portable air conditioners will provide powerful cooling air for rooms up to 300 sq. ft.. It’ s an air conditioner portable for rooms like living room, office, bedroom, kitchen, storeroom, garage, etc, helping to create a comfortable atmosphere in hot summer. The settable cooling temperature is between 61℉ - 90℉. ❄【3-IN-1 FUNCTIONAL AC】This portable air conditioner acts as a fan, air cooler and dehumidifier. These three modes can be switched randomly to not only release cold wind or cold air but also reduce air moisture to provide you and your family a healthy indoor environment. ❄【HIGH INTELLIGENT OPERATION】Our portable air conditioners feature an easily-read deluxe PCB display and a big soft-touch control panel, which could be effortlessly switched the power, mode, fan speed, temperature, timer and lock setting. Besides it, you could operate this portable room air conditioner via remote control. ❄【SAFETY & MONEY SAVING】Long-pressing the Lock key about 3 seconds to active the child-lock function to protect the child from accidental injury. The portable air conditioner features self-evaporate system to improve cooling efficiency. In addition, EER of this AC is Class A. ❄【EASY TO INSTALL AND MOVE】The exhaust hose, hose connector, window kit and window kit adapter are included in the package, you could easily assemble or disassemble the indoor portable air conditioner by reading the instruction book. The dimension and weight of this portable ac unit are 12.4 x 12.2 x 27.6 inches and 44lbs respectively. The weight is light, combined with its 360° rotatable casters, this room ac air conditioner unit can be moved to different rooms effortlessly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Se2LRuQVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUKO","source_asin":"B08R65DGZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-499695","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R65DGZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R65DGZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
