window.products.push({"id":499802,"name":"American Lager Home Beer Brewing Ingredient Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5117N6CT03L._AC_.jpg","description":"American lager, also called American light, this is the style we are all familiar with. This kit honors the American brewing tradition of 100 years ago making good American beer the way it should be! The recipe combines golden malt extract, granulated honey, and cara-pils grain that perfectly contrast the classic Cascade hop. You will find that all great beers have two things in common:  the finest ingredients and the best recipes.  Ours have both!  With freshness and quality in mind, we produce all our kits on demand.  We want you to make good beer the first time and every time. Our beer making kits come with complete instructions that are easy to read and follow.  They contain all the ingredients you will need to produce five gallons of great homebrew that you will be able to serve with pride.  All our beer kits include dry malt extract, specialty grains with a grain bag for steeping, hops, yeast, clarifier, and priming sugar (for carbonating). These beer brewing kits are so easy to make that even a first-time brewer can make great beer with one of these kits, but the quality and convenience keep even experienced home brewers coming back for more. You will need to own basic homebrewing equipment to boil, ferment and bottle this beer. If you do not own brewing equipment, please click on the link Other Products by The Home Brewery to see our starter equipment kits. Questions? Don't hesitate to give us a call. We are there when you need us for advise and support after the sale.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5117N6CT03L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Home Brewery","source_asin":"B0006OMPOO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-499802","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0006OMPOO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0006OMPOO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
