window.products.push({"id":499862,"name":"CuttleLab Airtight Glass Canisters Sets for the Kitchen, Glass Jars for Food Storage with Lids, Glass Storage Containers, Kitchen Jars, Use as Flour J","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816vSColDSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT SIZES - These beautiful 5-piece airtight storage jars are made of high-quality BPA free borosilicate glass canisters with airtight lids. The set of storage jars includes 1x (1.9 cup,15.2 oz, 450ml), 2 x(4.2 cup, 33.8oz, 1000ml), 1x (6.4cup, 50.7oz, 1500ml) and 1 x(8.5 cup, 67.6 oz, 2000ml). The combination of sizes allows you to use them as pasta jar, rice jar, cookie jar or simply use them to store any pantry staples. You can be sure that your food storage needs are met in style. NO MORE STORAGE PROBLEMS! - Shaped for space efficiency, these glass pantry jars are stackable, modular and can be arranged to fit any space. Our food jar lids are airtight and leak proof with unique, secure-fitting silicone, keeping food fresher for longer and reducing food waste. The lids of the glass storage jars are available in multiple colors and can be used to group and categorize various food types, making a beautiful display of ingredients in your pantry. STACK-ABLE WITH GREAT FEATURES - Unlike glass containers with bamboo lids, our meticulously designed silicone lids provide good grip and the storage jars will not easily slide off when stacked. The generous opening lets you refill and clean the glass containers with ease. Crystal clear glass makes it easy to find ingredients without opening the glass containers. CAN BE USED IN FRIDGES AND FREEZERS – These glass canisters can be used in household fridges and freezers. Not only are these kitchen jars great for pantry storage and organization, they can also be used to store juices, smoothies, salsas, dips or salad dressing in the fridge or freezer. These leak proof, airtight kitchen canisters help contain odors. WE GUARANTEE 100% SATISFACTION! We want you to be happy with your purchase, but if you are not, let us know and we will refund you 100%. Moreover, if you have questions or comments, let us know and we will be delighted to attend you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816vSColDSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CuttleLab","source_asin":"B087NV11QG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-499862","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087NV11QG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087NV11QG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
