window.products.push({"id":499934,"name":"Tbfit Large Square Storage Ottoman Bench, Tufted Upholstered Coffee Table Ottoman with Storage, Oversized Storage Ottomans Toy Box Footrest for Living","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LbFQj4BzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LARGE STORAGE: The size of the Tbfit square ottoman is 30\"L*30\"W*18\"H. Use the large storage ottoman to store extra throw blankets, pillows, toys, magazines, or other items, keeping them within reach but neatly out of sight. You will love how much your space can transform with the simple addition of this charming ottomans. STABLE AND DURABLE: Our oversized ottoman is made with a sturdy solid wood frame and durable wood legs, designed for long and lasting use. Durable solid wood legs can withstand a weight of 300 pounds. The soft cushion on the lid with a high-density sponge adds support without sacrificing any comfort, so your tea tray can be placed on it steadily. MULTIFUNCTIONAL: The storage ottoman cube not only brings a touch of class to your interior decor but also incredible function. It can keep your home tidy as a toy box, work as a coffee table to accompany you at night, provide a cozy rest for your tired feet, offer an extra stool for your friends. ELEGANCE AND REFINED: With a minimalistic yet refined structure, these ottomans bring out a simplistic style that emphasizes comfort and functionality. The button-tufted seat adds traditional elegance to the piece. Rivet design of retro style brings a dignified and elegant noble atmosphere to your home decoration. This storage ottoman bench will tie your home together with its stunning looks, making this the ideal addition to your space. EASY TO INSTALL: Easy to install, without any tools, just screw on 4 legs, you can add an exquisite ottoman to your living room or bedroom. We use durable hinges, so when you fully open it, the upholstered tops can stay open. For safety concerns, please do not let your family members under the age of 12 play around with the ottoman when the tops open. Tbfit has an excellent after-sale service team, please feel free to contact us if you have any questions. We are glad to serve you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LbFQj4BzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tbfit","source_asin":"B09TW6F6W3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-499934","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TW6F6W3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TW6F6W3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
