window.products.push({"id":499991,"name":"White Sage and Palo Santo Sticks Bundle for Burning Smudging and Spiritual Incense","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UF2LhKjgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HAPPY HOME ENERGY KIT and GUIDE- We’ve carefully put together an amazing starter smudge kit to help you bring calm and blessings to your life. Includes one 4” long Sage smudge stick, three Palo Santo Sticks and our Smudging Guide. RESTORE ENERGY - Bring calm and blessings into your life. HAND TIED WITH LOVE - Each sage smudge stick is hand picked, dried and carefully tied. Palo Santo known as the sacred wood is harvested from naturally fallen tree branches. A PERFECT GIFT – Our “Happy Home” Energy Kit makes the perfect house warming gift. Offer someone you care about the opportunity to bring balance and calm into their lives. HOW DOES IT WORK? - Our sage burns well and smells amazing just light one end of the sage, blow out the flame and the trail of fragrant smoke can be used to restore positive energy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UF2LhKjgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Picki Nicki","source_asin":"B07R7FJCGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-499991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R7FJCGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R7FJCGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":499992,"name":"3x Personalized Whiskey Stones, Laser Engraved Scotch Drink Stones Gift Set, Basalt Bourbon Rocks Set, Wedding, Birthday","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EA8LIXuvL._SL1024_.jpg","description":"Whether his spirit of choice is single-malt scotch, a nice bourbon, or a blended malt, our personalized Whiskey Stone Set is a great gift for the hardcore Whiskey Lover and newbie alike. The custom laser engraved 3-piece whiskey stone set is made from Basalt, a natural occurring volcanic rock and comes in a white storage box and with a black, velvet pouch. This personalized set can be a perfect addition to the main gift (like a bottle of good booze) or be presented on its own. The personalized Whiskey Stones are a wonderful gift idea for Birthdays, Weddings, Groomsman, Bachelor Parties, Father’s Day, Retirement, Anniversary and Christmas. They also make perfect corporate gifts for your Business Partners and VIP customers. How to use the whiskey stones: - Before first use, wash with soap and water - - Put them in the freezer for 2 hours or more- And add the stones to a drink that is ALREADY cold- The stones will keep the drink cold and won’t water it down  - Enjoy the cool, pure and non-diluted taste of your favorite drink- After using, rinse them and store the stones in the freezer for your next drink ★ Listing is for 1 (ONE) 3-piece Whiskey Stone Set ★ Measurements of each stone: 1\"x1\"x1” ★ Whiskey stones are made from Basalt, a natural occurring volcanic rock. ★ Color of Basalt stones can vary from black to gray.  ★ Stone Set comes with a black, velvet pouch. ★ Laser engraved and personalized on 1 side free of charge ★ The stones will automatically include the artwork shown in the pictures","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EA8LIXuvL._SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sin City Engraving","source_asin":"B07JYT8GM4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-499992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JYT8GM4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JYT8GM4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
